              "type": "M1",
              "text": "Finds correct probabilities: $P(X=0) = \\frac{3}{21} = \\frac{1}{7}$, $P(X=1) = \\frac{12}{21} = \\frac{4}{7}$, $P(X=2) = \\frac{6}{21} = \\frac{2}{7}$."
            },
