              "text": "Calculates $E(X) = 0\\left(\\frac{1}{7}\\right) + 1\\left(\\frac{4}{7}\\right) + 2\\left(\\frac{2}{7}\\right) = \\frac{8}{7}$."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_discrete_random_variables_m02_l02_cpq03_p02",
