              "text": "Calculates $E(X^2) = 0^2\\left(\\frac{1}{7}\\right) + 1^2\\left(\\frac{4}{7}\\right) + 2^2\\left(\\frac{2}{7}\\right) = \\frac{4 + 8}{7} = \\frac{12}{7}$."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_discrete_random_variables_m02_l02_cpq03_p02_c2",
              "type": "A1",
