              "text": "Sets up second moment $E(X^2) = \\frac{1^2(5) + 2^2(8) + 3^2(9) + 4^2(8) + 5^2(5)}{35} = \\frac{5 + 32 + 81 + 128 + 125}{35}$."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_discrete_random_variables_m02_l02_cpq04_p02_c2",
